// https://externalcontrollayer.ai/ns/schema/time-attestation/1 (schemas/ecl-time-attestation-v1.schema.json)
/** ECL Time Attestation v1 The payload of a trusted-time countersignature: a time authority's signed statement that the covered payload digest and the covered envelope signatures existed no later than issued_at (INTEGRITY-ENVELOPE-1 section 9). Its media type is application/vnd.ecl.time-attestation+json. */
